{"scene_id": "s02099", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02099.fountain", "heading": "INT. USED BOOKSTORE - POETRY ROOM - EVENING", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "MIC", "names": ["MIC"], "gender": "?", "first": 3, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 1, "name": "POETRY", "names": ["POETRY"], "gender": "?", "first": 3, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 2, "name": "MARISOL VEGA-RHODES", "names": ["MARISOL VEGA-RHODES", "MARISOL"], "gender": "?", "first": 4, "spoke": 16}, {"id": 3, "name": "ELIAS THORNBURY", "names": ["ELIAS THORNBURY", "ELIAS"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 12}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. USED BOOKSTORE - POETRY ROOM - EVENING", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A narrow room at the back of a sprawling shop, shelves bowed with paperbacks.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A podium, a lamp, and fifteen folding chairs, most of them empty.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A handwritten sign: OPEN MIC - POETRY - 7 PM.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "MARISOL VEGA-RHODES, 30s, in a green coat, stands at the podium with a folded page.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "In the front row, alone, sits ELIAS THORNBURY, 30s, a bookseller in an apron, holding a pencil he has forgotten to use.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thank you all for coming.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["to the room"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "There is no one else.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "She looks at the empty chairs.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "She smiles at them anyway.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "This is called \"Interlibrary Loan.\"", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "She unfolds the page.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Elias leans forward.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I borrowed you from a stranger's shelf and kept you longer than I should. The due date came, the due date went, and still I read you like a wood.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["reading"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Elias's pencil stops.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "She reads the next stanza quietly, glancing at him once, twice.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You were stamped by someone else, in blue. Their name is smudged, their initials blurred. I'd like to think they'd understand how long I held on to the word.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["reading"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "She finishes.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Folds the page.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "A silence.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Elias claps, slowly, three times.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That was good.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thank you.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is it about a book?", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It might be.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It sounds like it's about a person.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It might be that too.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "He stands.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Crosses the aisle.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Stops three feet from the podium.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Can I ask who?", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You can ask.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Who?", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You work here, don't you?", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then you should check your records. I've had a copy of \"Collected Neruda\" out for two years.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We don't lend books.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "He looks at her.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "She looks at the empty chairs, then at him.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Marisol.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Elias.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a used bookstore.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're not supposed to give them back.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I never meant to.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "He takes the pencil from behind his ear and puts it in his apron pocket.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "He reaches out, and she lets him take the page.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "He unfolds it, reads the last line, and folds it again.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I close at nine.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm not busy at nine.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Neither am I.", "name": "MARISOL", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "He tucks the poem into his apron.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "She steps down from the podium.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Together they turn off the lamp and leave fifteen chairs in the dark.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}